    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -680,
        "y": 60
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "The project's accuracy claim, with no Python anywhere: the whole ResNet-18 sits in the SequentialModel layer editor and everything else is node parameters. It is the CIFAR variant -- 3x3 stride-1 stem, no maxpool -- which is why it reaches 95% and not the 91% a stock ImageNet ResNet-18 gives on 32x32 images.\nSubmit it from the Runs panel with seed 1337 and deterministic on. 200 epochs took 22 minutes on an RTX 4080 and Print showed 0.9548 top-1. The first run downloads CIFAR-10, about 170 MB.\nREADME.md is the provenance record: the measured numbers and two runs that matched bitwise.\n\n本專案的準確率宣稱，而且整張圖沒有寫任何 Python：ResNet-18 全部放在 SequentialModel 的層編輯器裡，其餘都是節點參數。它是 CIFAR 版本（3x3 stride-1 的 stem、不做 maxpool），所以能到 95%，而不是原版 ImageNet ResNet-18 在 32x32 影像上的 91%。\n從 Runs 面板以 seed 1337、開啟 deterministic 送出執行。200 個 epoch 在 RTX 4080 上花 22 分鐘，Print 顯示 top-1 為 0.9548。第一次執行會下載 CIFAR-10，約 170 MB。\n旁邊的 README.md 是完整紀錄：量到的數字，以及兩次逐位元相同的執行。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -420,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 360
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-model",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 40,
        "y": 232
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Every layer of the ResNet-18 is inside this node's layer editor: 68 layer nodes, 77 connections, 11,173,962 parameters. Do not place them by hand -- the editor's Import reads this directory's graph.json directly, and Export writes the same format back out.\n\n整個 ResNet-18 都在這顆節點的層編輯器裡：68 個層節點、77 條連線、11,173,962 個參數。不要手動擺放：層編輯器的 Import 可以直接讀這個目錄的 graph.json，Export 也會寫回同樣的格式。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "model",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 172
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    },
