      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "This is the standard CIFAR-10 recipe: SGD with Nesterov, lr 0.1, momentum 0.9, weight decay 5e-4, and batch 128 on the DataLoader. The augmentation half is RandomCrop(32, padding 4) and RandomHorizontalFlip on the training split only; both splits get the same channel normalization.\n\n這就是 CIFAR-10 的標準配方：SGD 加 Nesterov、lr 0.1、momentum 0.9、weight decay 5e-4，DataLoader 的 batch 是 128。資料增強那一半是 RandomCrop(32, padding 4) 與 RandomHorizontalFlip，而且只套在訓練集上；兩個分割共用同一組通道正規化。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "opt",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -360,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-sched",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 1380,
        "y": 872
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "T_max has to stay equal to TrainingLoop.epochs. Cosine annealing steps once per epoch here and is meant to reach zero exactly at the end; when the two disagree TrainingLoop warns and runs anyway, so nothing stops you and the accuracy simply comes out lower.\n\nT_max 要和 TrainingLoop.epochs 保持一致。這裡的 cosine annealing 每個 epoch 走一步，設計上要在訓練結束時剛好降到零；兩者不一致時 TrainingLoop 只會警告並照樣執行，所以沒有東西會擋你，只是準確率會變低。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "sched",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 172
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    }
